{
  "title": "命運不是直線",
  "title_en": "Fate Is Not a Straight Line",
  "series": "神話未完成",
  "series_en": "Myths in the Making",
  "volume": 30,
  "model": "史旺姬",
  "creator": "史旺基 Swanky",
  "slug": "swanky-ji-fate-is-not-a-straight-line",
  "date": "2026-10-29",
  "count": 36,
  "cover_photo": 14,
  "setting": "石砌梯坡邊的白斑老樹",
  "subtitle": "",
  "subtitle_en": "",
  "lead": "水繞過樹根，沒有筆直的去處。她取了一杯水，試著把白泥留在樹皮上。泥會乾裂，碗也會翻倒。有人坐下，有人接過刷子，樹仍留著未被覆蓋的部分。",
  "lead_en": "Water bends around the roots. She carries a cup and tries to leave pale clay on the bark. Clay cracks. A bowl falls. Someone sits down; someone else takes the brush. Parts of the tree remain uncovered.",
  "statement_title": "",
  "statement": "水繞過樹根，沒有筆直的去處。她取了一杯水，試著把白泥留在樹皮上。泥會乾裂，碗也會翻倒。有人坐下，有人接過刷子，樹仍留著未被覆蓋的部分。\n\n碗回到泉邊。\n她沿著彎曲的水路離開，\n白痕沒有連成一條線。",
  "statement_en": "Water bends around the roots. She carries a cup and tries to leave pale clay on the bark. Clay cracks. A bowl falls. Someone sits down; someone else takes the brush. Parts of the tree remain uncovered.\n\nThe bowl returns to the spring.\nShe leaves beside the winding water.\nThe pale marks never form a single line.",
  "afterword": "碗回到泉邊。\n她沿著彎曲的水路離開，\n白痕沒有連成一條線。",
  "afterword_en": "The bowl returns to the spring.\nShe leaves beside the winding water.\nThe pale marks never form a single line.",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
